| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Name | Horizon |
| Version | 4.1.3 |
| Author | Shopify |
| Preset | Horizon |
| Docs | https://help.shopify.com/manual/online-store/themes |
| Support | https://support.shopify.com/ |
| Dev store | `horizon-cursor-jpf40muy.myshopify.com` |
| Repo | https://github.com/DevsoopAgency/Horizon-Cursor.git |

